              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n  \"afterId\": null,\n  \"beforeId\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/work-items/{{workItemId}}/move",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "work-items",
                "{{workItemId}}",
                "move"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "open",
                  "value": "true",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Only items whose own status is not Done, also under open epics (TREK-52)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "todo",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Repeat for any of these statuses: todo, in_progress, in_review, done"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "in_progress",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "epic",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Repeat to keep only these types, e.g. the parent types an item allows (TRK-11.1)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "story",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "assignee",
                  "value": "me",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Repeat: a user id, me, or none for unassigned"
                },
                {
                  "key": "assignee",
                  "value": "none",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "parent",
                  "value": "TRK-1",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Items under this epic or story at any depth: its key or id"
                },
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Key prefix (TRK-1) or title text, case-insensitive"
                },
                {
                  "key": "completedEpics",
                  "value": "show",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "hide (default) leaves out every epic in Done and everything under it; show keeps them"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "A card dropped on the board (US-11 AC3, AC4). status is the column: the current one to reorder, or one the workflow allows (422 with allowedTransitions otherwise; recorded as WorkItemStatusChanged). afterId and beforeId are the cards directly above and below the drop in that column, null at the top or bottom; both null for an empty column. 409 when they are no longer next to each other. Done is last finished first, so afterId and beforeId must be null there (400). A neighbour that is the moved card itself, or afterId equal to beforeId, is also a 400. A reorder alone is not in history and does not change updatedAt; dropping a card where it already is changes nothing. If-Match is required (428) and must be the latest ETag (412 otherwise). Send the same filters as Get board (TREK-52): afterId and beforeId must be neighbours among the cards those filters show, and the card lands directly below afterId (or above beforeId at the top) for every viewer."
          }
